{"product_id":"digital-tv-over-broadband","title":"Digital TV over broadband","description":"\u003cp\u003eA thorough but easy-to-read explanation of the new TV technology Discusses the convergence of TV with computers and telecommunications Covers the business models and scenarios of DTV adoption, webcasting, and the rollout of interactive services This new edition explains how current technological developments are revolutionizing television. The emphasis is on the recent shift in focus from HDTV to a more broadly defined DTV and to the increasing importance of webcasting for interactive television.\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Joan M. Van Tassel\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780240803579\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 224\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 35 x 240\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.in","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41750564831385,"sku":"2RD9780240803579","price":30.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/digital-tv-over-broadband-717500.jpg?v=1694790264","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/digital-tv-over-broadband","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}